# sbx-agent update signing keys (ed25519), spec S3 section 17.3.
# One key per line: "ed25519 <base64 of the 32-byte public key> <comment>".
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored. A package verifies if
# manifest.sig matches any listed key. The line below is the current key; for
# rotation a "next" key line is added here in advance and shipped in a package
# signed with the current key. The private key lives outside the repository
# (PoC: ~/.config/sbx/update-signing/ed25519.key).
ed25519 vo/77czm2ho6dvwtv4luPyJ2/FaEWvrPybqZs1IZ+3Y= sbx-update-poc-2026-10-30 current
